              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "Do not send this from Postman.\n\nThis is a real OAuth redirect flow \u2014 Postman can't complete Google's login form.\n\nTo test for real:\n1. Set GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID / GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET / GOOGLE_CALLBACK_URL in .env (see README)\n2. Open {{baseUrl}}/auth/google directly in a browser\n3. Log in with a Google account\n4. You'll land on /auth/google/callback with a JSON response containing accessToken/refreshToken, same shape as a normal login"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/google",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
